                                    <h2>The D2C Market in Sydney + Australia</h2>
                                    <p>Australia D2C ecosystem: 600+ funded brands, AUD 15B+ aggregate revenue. Sydney hosts largest concentration + Melbourne significant secondary hub. Peer set: Cotton On (Melbourne but Sydney presence), Aesop (skincare, Melbourne-founded), Zip Co (BNPL fintech D2C), plus growing Australia + international expansion brands.</p>
                                    <h2>Categories That Compound in Sydney + Australia</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Wellness + supplements:</strong> Strong wellness culture + values-driven consumer.<br><strong>Athleisure + activewear:</strong> Strong fitness culture + outdoor lifestyle.<br><strong>Sustainable + eco brands:</strong> Very strong sustainability positioning.<br><strong>Beauty + skincare:</strong> Aesop legacy + growing local D2C beauty.<br><strong>F&amp;B + specialty coffee:</strong> Strong coffee + wine + specialty food.<br><strong>Home + lifestyle:</strong> Post-pandemic home focus + design-forward.<br><strong>Ethnic wear + South Asian diaspora:</strong> Growing Indian + Sri Lankan + Bangladeshi communities.</p>
                                    <h2>Realistic Budgets in Sydney</h2>
