                                    <h2>Regulatory Requirements — Australia</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Australian Privacy Principles (APPs)</strong> — under Privacy Act 1988. Ongoing reform.<br><strong>TGA (Therapeutic Goods Administration)</strong> — required listing for cosmetics + wellness + medical claims.<br><strong>ACCC (Australian Competition + Consumer Commission)</strong> — advertising claim regulation.<br><strong>NICNAS / AICIS</strong> — chemical + ingredient regulation.<br><strong>BNPL regulation</strong> — Afterpay + Zip + growing framework.<br><strong>State-based sales tax</strong> — GST national + varied state considerations.</p>
